  "ja330:1.1": "Sīlaṃ kir' eva kalyāṇaṃ, ",
  "ja330:1.2": "sīlaṃ loke anuttaraṃ, ",
  "ja330:1.3": "passa: ghoraviso nāgo ",
  "ja330:1.4": "sīlavāti na haññatīti. Yāvad ev' ",
  "ja330:2.1": "ass' ahū kiñci ",
  "ja330:2.2": "tāvad eva akhādisu ",
  "ja330:2.3": "saṃgamma kulalā loke, ",
  "ja330:2.4": "na hiṃsanti akiñcananti. ",
  "ja330:3.1": "Sukhaṃ nirāsā supati, ",
  "ja330:3.2": "āsā phalavatī sukhā, ",
  "ja330:3.3": "āsaṃ nirāsaṃ katvāna ",
  "ja330:3.4": "sukhaṃ supati Piṅgalāti. ",
  "ja330:4.1": "Na samādhiparo atthi ",
  "ja330:4.2": "asmiṃ loke paramhi ca, ",
  "ja330:4.3": "na paraṃ nāpi attānaṃ ",
  "ja330:4.4": "vihiṃsati samāhitoti. ",
